    <style>
        @page Section1 {
            size: 210mm 297mm;
            margin: 15mm 15mm 15mm 15mm;
            mso-header-margin: 10mm;
            mso-footer-margin: 10mm;
            mso-paper-source: 0;
        }
        div.Section1 {
            page: Section1;
        }
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: #000000;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .kop-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border-bottom: 2.5pt solid #6b0c22;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .kop-table td {
            border: none;
            padding: 4px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .kop-title {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .kop-title h3 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13pt;
            color: #6b0c22;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .kop-title h4 {
            margin: 2px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 10.5pt;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .kop-title p {
            margin: 2px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #475569;
        }
        .main-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .main-title h4 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .main-title small {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #64748b;
        }
        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background-color: #fff1f2;
            border: 1pt solid #fecdd3;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .meta-table td {
            border: none;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
        }
        .petunjuk-box {
            background-color: #f0fdf4;
            border-left: 3pt solid #16a34a;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #14532d;
        }
        .data-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 8pt;
        }
        .data-table th, .data-table td {
            border: 1pt solid #000000;
            padding: 5px 6px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .data-table th {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .badge {
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 1px 4px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 7pt;
        }
        .badge-adm { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
        .badge-ket { background-color: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
        .badge-ang { background-color: #e0e7ff; color: #3730a3; }
        .notes-box {
            height: 38px;
            border: 0.5pt dashed #94a3b8;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .sig-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
        }
        .sig-table td {
            border: none;
            padding: 4px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 50%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="Section1">

    <!-- KOP -->
    <table class="kop-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="kop-title">
                <h3>UNIVERSITAS KRISTEN DUTA WACANA</h3>
                <h4>LEMBAGA PENGEMBANGAN AKADEMIK DAN INOVASI PEMBELAJARAN (LPAIP)</h4>
                <p>Skripsi: Sistem Informasi Manajemen Tim Ad Hoc Berbasis Web (Goal-Directed Design & Evolutionary Prototyping)</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- JUDUL -->
    <div class="main-title">
        <h4>LEMBAR PENCATATAN EVALUASI PROTOTYPE FIGMA (ITERASI I)</h4>
        <small>Dokumen Lampiran Sub-bab 3.4.5 Refinement — Peneliti: Rizky Chrales Christiaan (NIM: 71220902)</small>
    </div>

    <!-- DATA RESPONDEN -->
    <table class="meta-table">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 15%; font-weight: bold;">Nama Responden</td>
            <td style="width: 35%;">: ................................................................</td>
            <td style="width: 18%; font-weight: bold;">Tanggal Pengujian</td>
            <td style="width: 32%;">: ....................................................</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">NIP / NIM</td>
            <td>: ................................................................</td>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Peran Pengguna (Role)</td>
            <td>: [ &nbsp; ] Admin LPAIP &nbsp; [ &nbsp; ] Ketua &nbsp; [ &nbsp; ] Anggota</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Jabatan / Unit Kerja</td>
            <td>: ................................................................</td>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Waktu Pengujian</td>
            <td>: ............ s.d. ............ WIB</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- PETUNJUK -->
    <div class="petunjuk-box">
        <strong>Petunjuk Penguji (Peneliti):</strong>
        1. Bacakan kalimat instruksi tugas secara langsung kepada responden tanpa mengarahkan langkah tombol.<br>
        2. Amati responden saat mencoba prototype Figma.<br>
        3. Beri tanda centang [✓] pada status: <em>Berhasil tanpa bantuan</em>, <em>Berhasil dengan bantuan</em>, atau <em>Belum berhasil</em>.<br>
        4. Catat kendala yang dialami responden serta komentar dan umpan baliknya.
    </div>

    <!-- TABEL 3.9 EVALUASI -->
    <h4 style="margin: 8px 0 4px 0; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #6b0c22;">Tabel 3.9 Pencatatan Evaluasi Prototype Figma</h4>
    <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 5%; text-align: center;">No</th>
